> I intended to read the blessed one first, and perhaps I did. My luck must have been negative. Blessed scrolls should give you two items, if you have positive luck. It was a new moon, so maybe it was at -1. Anyway, I only got one item from the first scroll, and I got everything from the second one. 
AFAIK the new moon doesn't affect luck in the way a full moon does; it
only gives you a reduced chance that rooms are lit.

Anyway, unless I have a pressing need, I usually wait reading my
identify scrolls until I have a way to bless them.  The 20% effect of
identifying your whole inventory can make the game so much easier,
especially if you have collected a bunch that can be blessed as a stack.

